1. SCOPE

   This repository contains deployment packaging for the EdSpace application:
   the Helm chart, Docker Compose files, Azure Managed Application templates,
   the configuration contract and generated schemas, scripts, and
   documentation (together, "the Packaging").

   The Packaging does not contain the EdSpace application. The application is
   distributed separately as a container image from EdSpace's registry, under
   credentials issued to you by EdSpace.

2. RELATIONSHIP TO YOUR AGREEMENT

   Your use of the EdSpace application is governed by the subscription or
   license agreement between you and EdSpace ("the Agreement"). This file
   governs the Packaging only. Where this file and the Agreement conflict, the
   Agreement controls.

3. GRANT

   If you hold a current Agreement, EdSpace grants you a non-exclusive,
   non-transferable, revocable right to use, copy, and modify the Packaging
   for the sole purpose of deploying, configuring, and operating the EdSpace
   application in infrastructure you control, for your own internal use.

4. RESTRICTIONS

   Except where the Agreement expressly permits otherwise, you may not:

   (a) redistribute, publish, sublicense, sell, or otherwise make the
       Packaging or any derivative of it available to third parties;

   (b) use the Packaging to deploy or operate the EdSpace application on
       behalf of a third party, or to provide a hosted, managed, or
       service-bureau offering to others;

   (c) share, publish, or transfer the registry credentials issued to you, or
       redistribute the EdSpace container images those credentials grant
       access to;

   (d) remove or obscure this notice, or any copyright or attribution notice
       contained in the Packaging.

   Reading, auditing, and reviewing the Packaging — including by your own
   staff, auditors, or security assessors under obligations of
